  "description": "Your real-time scores and stats app, fast and simple.\n\n\u2022 As fast as a sports app can be. Get updates in real time with Live Activities on your Lock Screen, and box scores and more on game pages.\n\u2022 Follow teams, leagues, divisions, brackets and tournaments, and personalize your home view in the app.\n\u2022 Add a widget to your Home Screen to get quick access to scores and upcoming schedules.\n\u2022 The best place to be a fan. Watch live games on Apple TV or catch up on breaking stories with Apple News when you sync your sports.\n\u2022 Includes A-League Men, Argentine Liga Profesional, Austrian Bundesliga, Belgian Pro League, Brazilian S\u00e9rie A, Bundesliga, Bundesliga 2, Champions League, Chilean Primera Divisi\u00f3n, Colombian Primera A, Conference League, Copa del Rey, Coppa Italia, Coupe de France, DFB-Pokal, Ecuadorian Serie A, EFL Championship, EFL Cup, Egyptian Premier League, Ekstraklasa, Eredivisie, Europa League, F1, FA Cup, FBS and FCS, Greek Super League 1, Indian Super League, Israeli Premier League, J1 League, NCAA College Football, LaLiga, Liga F, Leagues Cup, LIGA MX, Ligue 1, Ligue 2, LPGA Tour, Men\u2019s College Basketball, Men\u2019s Tennis, MLB, MLS, NASCAR, NBA, NFL, NHL, NWSL, Peruvian Primera Divisi\u00f3n, PGA Tour, Premiership, Premier League, Primeira Liga, Saudi Pro League, Segunda Divisi\u00f3n, Serie A, Serie B, South African Premiership, Superliga, S\u00fcper Lig, Super League, WNBA, Women\u2019s Champions League, Women\u2019s College Basketball, Women\u2019s Super League, and Women\u2019s Tennis.\n\nRequirements:\n\n\u2022 Availability and features may vary by country, region or device.\n\u2022 Apple Sports is free to use and is available for all iPhone models running iOS 18 or later.\n\u2022 Features require internet access over a Wi-Fi or cellular data connection.",
